    // raised at the parked yield (abnf/jsrtjsprint.go's genReturn), so the finally
    // clauses around that yield run as the body's own code. Every catch clause of the
    // body passes the marker on (makeTry), a yield* hands it to its delegate's return()
    // (makeYieldStar), and genRetBody catches it at the top and RETURNS its value - the
    // return completion node resumes the body with. inPlainGen is carried into the
    // try/catch closures like inAsyncFn, and pendingPlainGen arms it for one body.
